<title>USA: Dignity Partners to change name, symbol.</title>
<headline>Dignity Partners to change name, symbol.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dignity Partners Inc said Friday it will change its name to Point West Capital Corp on August 1.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it will change its trading symbol from DPNR.O to PWCC.O.</p>
</text>
